WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.079
Welcome to the final lesson. You have done the work.

00:00:09.079 --> 00:00:14.840
You've coached, you've reflected,

00:00:14.840 --> 00:00:18.137
and you've grown. This isn't just an ending.

00:00:18.137 --> 00:00:21.360
It's a commencement. It's about celebrating

00:00:21.360 --> 00:00:24.493
the progress you and your player have made,

00:00:24.493 --> 00:00:27.480
and intentionally planning for what comes

00:00:27.480 --> 00:00:29.498
next. In our first segment,

00:00:29.498 --> 00:00:34.280
we'll focus on how to make the new habits you've built permanent

00:00:34.280 --> 00:00:37.400
and make them a part of your leadership operating system.
